{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6c6911af-6d44-86bf-bdf9-e00880b28a0d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T16:07:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. My name is Nilson Semedo. I'm calling about the property tax, the first installment. I paid it already and I just want to make sure it posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. May I have the service address for the account, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 2 Broadway, in the North End. I rent there, but the landlord has me paying it through the, um, the arrangement we have. So the bill comes to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. One moment while I pull that up. Can you tell me approximately when you made the payment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me think. It was, uh, the first week of February. I went in, the lady at the window, she said it would show in a few days and then I said okay, so I just want to confirm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Are you still there, Mr. Semedo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sorry, I'm texting my nephew, he's asking about a ride. Go ahead, I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a problem. I do see a payment recorded against that parcel in the first week of February, applied to the first installment. It shows as posted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, good. So that's the first one, it's fully paid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the first installment shows as paid in full. The next installment will have its own due date on your bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. My brother in law said I should get a receipt, and I said I have the receipt, but I wanted to hear it from you folks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keep that receipt with your records. Is there anything else I can assist with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, one more. What are the hours for the assessor's office? [pause] Sorry, hold on, one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. The assessor's hours, you were saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hadn't said yet. The assessor's office is open Monday through Friday during regular City Hall business hours, generally eight thirty to four thirty. It would be best to call ahead if you need to see someone in particular."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight thirty to four thirty. Okay. So they're still open now, but not for long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is just past four, so they are still open for another half hour or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll probably call tomorrow then. That's all I needed. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Semedo. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T16:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
